OL,3,GNEWSAThe neolithic monument buried
OL,4,Abeneath a county town
OL,5,
OL,6,FHidden beneath a shopping arcade and an
OL,7,Funremarkable supermarket car park in a
OL,8,Fhistoric county town lies an enormous
OL,9,F4,000-year-old open secret.
OL,11,FBuilt during the neolithic period, what
OL,12,Fremains today of Dorchester henge is
OL,13,Flocated beneath the modern town.
OL,15,FUnlike Stonehenge, which is widely
OL,16,Fconsidered England's most famous
OL,17,Fprehistoric monument, the Dorset town's
OL,18,Fhenge was not built with stone,
OL,19,Ffeaturing instead an enormous palisade
OL,20,Fof large oak timber posts.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
